WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:10.770
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.980
I've got to start practicing right away!

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:11.950
Hey, don't you think this is a little strange?

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:13.340
What is?

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:16.630
For the middle school finals, and third place match,

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:20.120
all the participants were gathered together when the theme was announced.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.920
So why are they using such a small bulletin board for the real tournament?

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:25.190
True...

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:31.060
I guess there's some reason why the middle and high schools have separate announcements.

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:32.600
Quiet, everyone!

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:37.760
I will now make the announcement about the finals of the Cake Grand Prix that will take place next Sunday.

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:45.230
The theme, as well as the subject...

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:53.240
Cake Grand Prix
Final Round

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:45.310
Cake Grand Prix
Final Round

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:45.310
Theme & Subject on

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:45.310
Announcement Day

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:48.540
...will be announced the day of the match.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:53.240
On the day of the finals, the judge, Henri-sensei, will announce them in person.

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:55.840
What?

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:05.120
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:05.120
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

