Since I opened the door of chance, my mood lifted.

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:25.130
youkoso suiitsu no oukoku he

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:25.130
Welcome to the Kingdom of Sweets.

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:26.040
Bon appétit!

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:33.410
hajimehane, hetappi demo megezu ni hibishoujin<i>!</i>

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:33.410
Though I was terrible at the beginning, I was diligent everyday<i>!</i>

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:36.090
「makeruna<i>! atashi」</i>

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:36.090
「I won't lose<i>!</i> I said to myself」

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:37.060
Courage!

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:43.840
My dream migakeba hikaru takaramono

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:43.840
My dream when polished is a shining treasure.

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:46.600
fairy chikara kashite<i>!</i>

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:46.600
Fairy, lend me your strength<i>!</i>

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:51.970
shifon, se shibon, juré, bonjuuru, hatsuratsu furuutsu, raburii made go!

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:51.970
Chiffon, C'est si bon, Gelée, Bonjour, Lively fruits, Lovely made go!

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:58.080
nakitaku natte mo egao ni nareru mahou

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:58.080
Even if you cry, there is magic that can make you smile.

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:03.330
「oishii<i>!」 wo tsukurutte omoikkiri tanoshii ne</i>

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:03.330
「Delicious<i>!</i>」 and making it wholeheartedly is fun.

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:09.320
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:09.320
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:14.670
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:14.670
I'll give happiness to you, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:19.210
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, fun fun

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:19.210
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, fun, fun

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:21.430
yume ni eeru<i>!</i>

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:21.430
Get them in our dreams<i>!</i>

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:25.890
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:34.060
It's morning already! Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors!

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:41.300
I see... Same-day announcement...

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:42.090
So that's how it is.

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:49.190
Rui, Reiji, Ryo, we're going.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:56.410
It sure looks like Princess Mari is taking this seriously.

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:06.180
recipe 36

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:06.180
Night before the Finals <i>!</i>

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:08.930
Cake Grand Prix
Final Round

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:08.930
Theme & Subject on

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:09.120
Announcement Day

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:13.140
Oh, no... The subject will be announced the day of the match?

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:14.640
Stay strong!

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:15.340
Rumi-san!

00:03:15.740 --> 00:03:21.340
You see, all of the people in our class have something to give you!

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:23.590
This is...

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:25.820
The records of Team Tennouji's previous matches.

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:32.850
We tried to think of how we could support you guys, so everyone put it together for you.

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:38.160
Wow... It's so detailed.

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:41.710
It has all the info, starting from the first round.

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:45.850
Our Team Koshiro was no match for Team Tennouji.

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:48.130
They're a far stronger opponent than you may imagine.

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:49.590
Ayukawa-san...

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:54.000
If you beat Team Tennouji, you'll be everyone's shining star of hope!

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.090
Good luck!

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:56.350
Go for the win!

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:58.200
Thank you, everyone!

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:01.200
We'll work to live up to your expectations!

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.010
We'll win, definitely, for sure!

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:08.040
...is what I said.

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:11.310
But the more I look at these...

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:17.400
Team Tennouji's sweets are just too high-level!

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:23.220
Team Tennouji's other members are also top-class within the academy.

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:24.900
They're really that amazing?

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:26.240
Yes.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:29.510
First there's the Student Council Vice President, Kaidoh Rui.

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:34.460
He's said to be President Tennouji's right hand man, and she has immense trust in him.

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:39.070
The other two are Takigawa Reiji-senpai and Saeki Ryo-senpai.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:42.260
They won top prizes at the Cake Grand Prix last year.

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:47.500
Wow, so they're kind of like the high school's Sweets Princes.

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:48.760
Who cares about that!

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:50.760
But, Amano...

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:54.270
Do you understand what having the subject and theme of the finals announced the day of means?

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:56.570
What are you talking about?

00:04:56.570 --> 00:05:00.380
Before we walk into that hall we'll have no idea what we'll be tested on.

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:03.940
In other words, we've got to be able to handle anything, or we're screwed.

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:08.960
Previously we've always decided what to make beforehand,

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:11.480
and practiced together carefully.

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:15.290
But for the finals that will be completely impossible.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:17.020
I see.

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:21.130
But Team Tennouji is in the same situation, right?

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.730
That is true.

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:29.130
But considering the gap in knowledge and technique acquired between us, it's possible that we will be at a disadvantage.

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:35.840
After all, Team Tennouji has been studying here at St. Marie Academy for four years longer than we have.

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:37.540
Four years...

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:39.520
For you it's five.

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.530
Oh, right...

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:45.880
Therefore, there's only one thing for us to do.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:47.740
Thank you for waiting!

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:54.010
These were heavy!

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:57.040
Honestly! This is not how you're supposed to use Spirits!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.890
What did you bring?

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:04.320
Decoration
Sure-Fire Methods

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:01.890
Tada!

00:06:01.890 --> 00:06:04.300
These are the textbooks from the high school!

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:09.090
I asked my mother to borrow them from the high school teachers.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:13.140
Satsuki's mother is the flower arrangement teacher, so she has influence.

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:18.350
We'll refer these to master as many of the high school level techniques as possible.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:19.420
I see.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:23.230
That's all we can do, isn't it?

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:26.150
We each have our own strengths and weaknesses.

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:29.420
From now on, we should study individually.

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:32.530
Everyone, let's do our best to raise our skills!

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:33.120
Right!

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:38.160
That's the way, Kashino!

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:41.100
Delicately, delicately...

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:46.170
Western style anko?

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:50.010
The temperature regulation looks tricky...

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:51.680
Yes, that's right.

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:55.760
Decorating baked sweets is no problem for you, Satsuki.

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:03.690
Don't worry, Ichigo... That's excellent for your first time.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.440
I'm tired!

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:09.530
What? Giving up after only one day?

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:12.170
No, obviously... But...

00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:14.410
I'm really hungry.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.030
I see.

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:22.290
When you're feeling tired, you can't beat sweets!

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:28.180
Gâteau chocolate, rare cheesecake, chocolate cake, Mont Blanc!

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:30.460
Wait for me, everyone!

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.120
I'll be eating you shortly-

00:07:34.990 --> 00:07:38.100
Please don't stop suddenly, Ichigo!

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:41.100
Tennouji-san...

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.810
She's at the Salon de Marie so late?

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:50.320
I see you're interested in your opponent?

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:52.820
Henri-sensei!

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:59.960
Until a moment ago, she was in the high school cooking classroom practicing for the finals.

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:04.760
And she is also helping out at the Salon de Marie as usual.

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:05.830
Wow...

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:09.480
You already heard about the finals, right?

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:13.130
Yes. They said that you'll tell us the subject and theme the day of the match, Henri-sensei.

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:15.140
Oh?

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:20.900
I feel it's a bit rough on Team Ichigo from the middle school.

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:25.020
But that just shows how high expectations for you are.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:27.570
Is that so?

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:29.070
But I'm...

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:30.980
Ichigo?

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:34.980
I came here because I wanted to eat some cake.

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:38.270
But, now's not the time for that, is it?

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:41.590
I still have a lot of things I should be doing.

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:43.580
Yes, that's right.

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:47.760
I'll do my best to catch up to Tennouji-san.

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:48.760
Amano-san.

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:52.650
T-Tennouji-san!

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:55.530
That was just a figure of speech! Or something...

00:08:55.530 --> 00:08:57.140
I'm sorry.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.970
Let's both do our best for the finals.

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:04.890
Henri-sensei, come on in.

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:05.810
Until next time.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.810
S-Sure...

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:11.120
And you, Amano-san?

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:13.250
It's okay...

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:16.110
I have to go back and read this.

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:19.620
That's a textbook from the high school.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:21.290
Yes!

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:24.200
I'm studying this for special training.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.330
I see.

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:29.100
There is nothing wrong with your methods.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.000
The way you are now...

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:35.760
...you will never catch up to me.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:54.860
I won't be able to catch up to Tennouji-san?

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:57.550
What did she mean?

00:09:57.550 --> 00:09:59.950
I wonder why she said that?

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:05.970
Maybe it's because she fears the progress you're making?

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:07.900
I doubt it.

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:10.380
Even during today's practice...

00:10:12.530 --> 00:10:14.670
I was the only one who screwed up.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:20.010
Like Kashino said, I have the least experience at making sweets.

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:25.810
If anyone is going to hold us back, it's me.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:29.070
I-chi-go!

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:30.400
What?

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:33.100
What are you saying now?

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:37.150
You've been working harder than everyone ever since you came to St. Marie!

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:41.690
If you do your best, you can catch up to President Tennouji this time, too!

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:43.670
I believe in you!

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:45.770
B-But that's...

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:49.490
So until the finals, I don't want you showing any weakness!

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:52.080
Because if you do, you won't win even if you had the chance!

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:55.240
Show no weakness.

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:57.170
Yeah, that's right!

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:58.870
Of course!

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:01.390
Be more like me, and stay in high spirits!

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:04.560
You're always cheering me up, Vanilla.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:05.530
Thank you.

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:08.850
Well, it's part of our duty as Spirits.

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:11.810
Geez, Vanilla.

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:19.290
It's from home.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:20.900
Hello?

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:23.650
Oh, Onee-chan, you're awake?

00:11:23.650 --> 00:11:24.920
Natsume?

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:26.160
What's up?

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:31.040
We heard that you're in the finals of the Cake Grand Prix!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.080
That's amazing!

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:35.020
Uh, it's not so amazing, really...

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:36.290
Give me!

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:37.830
Ichigo!

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:40.280
If you win then you'll go to Paris, right!?

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:45.180
Please don't do that! As your father, I'm begging you!

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:47.970
Stay in Japan!

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:49.720
What are you talking about?

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:53.990
You should be happy that your daughter is trying to spread her wings out into the world!

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:56.770
Ichigo, ignore what Papa said.

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:57.770
You'd better win!

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.310
Yeah, I get it.

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:05.390
Umm, I have a piano concour next Sunday as well.

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:07.580
You do your best in the finals too, okay?

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:10.870
I see! Well, guess I'd better not lose to you.

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:12.740
I've got to win myself!

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:14.930
That's the spirit.

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:15.460
Bye!

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:17.610
Natsume!

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:18.490
What?

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:22.130
I have something I want to ask.

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:29.220
Amano, what are you doing?

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:32.390
What do you plan to do with all those basic supplies?

00:12:33.220 --> 00:12:35.770
I've decided that this is my special training.

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:38.730
Your special training... What do you mean?

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:42.390
You see, last night I ran into Tennouji-san and she told me:

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:46.600
"The way you are now, you will never catch up to me."

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:48.110
She did?

00:12:48.110 --> 00:12:52.010
So I thought about what she meant...

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:56.630
And right then, I got a phone call from my little sister.

00:12:56.630 --> 00:13:05.070
Umm, if you were up against someone in the concour that was way older than you, and who had better technique and everything than you,

00:13:05.070 --> 00:13:07.370
how would you practice, Natsume?

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:10.690
For example, would you learn a new piece?

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:12.390
Well that's obvious!

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:15.330
You should practice the fundamentals as much as you can!

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:16.690
R-Really?

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:20.500
You can't rush preparing a new piece.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:25.400
You should repeat what you've been practicing for a long time, and do battle with your<i> piece.</i>

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:32.910
That's when I realised that it was the same as what Ameya-sensei taught us before the third place match.

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:40.000
I, who don't have much experience, won't be able to catch up to Tennouji-san by rushing to learn new techniques.

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:43.670
Instead, I'll fight using what I know how to do now.

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:47.420
And for that, I'll practice the basics!

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:49.020
I see.

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:51.850
Your little sister is really well grounded.

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:53.230
Indeed.

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:56.680
I really can't believe she's actually your little sister, Ichigo.

00:13:56.680 --> 00:13:58.850
What's that supposed to mean!?

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.690
Amano... Are you okay with that?

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:03.690
Yeah.

00:14:04.140 --> 00:14:07.750
Then leave the high school techniques to us.

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:10.900
If there's something you don't know, we'll teach you during the match.

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:14.120
It might waste some time though... Are you sure?

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:15.320
I'll be fine.

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:17.270
Then, it's decided.

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:20.000
Do your best practicing the basics, Ichigo-chan.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.210
We'll handle the rest.

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:27.170
Everyone... I'm sorry for being selfish like this.

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.780
Thank you!

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:31.550
I'll go get the ingredients right away!

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:34.510
She...

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:40.260
When we've practiced so far, it's mostly been us teaching her step by step.

00:14:40.260 --> 00:14:44.140
But this time she decided on what to do all by herself.

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:48.040
Feeling lonely because your child is finally standing on her own?

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:49.770
As if.

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:52.570
It's how Ichigo-chan would think.

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:53.890
Let's leave it to her.

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:55.620
Yeah.

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:06.870
Ichigo, can I leave this spatula here?

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:13.060
She's concentrating really hard...

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:15.570
I can't bother her right now.

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:23.230
Oh my, you too?

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:26.890
Andou and the others are all practicing hard like in a real battle.

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:30.450
They won't answer us even if we talk to them.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:33.470
I've never felt something like this.

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:35.120
Like the atmosphere is really tense.

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:38.370
I can understand why, but it makes me a little worried.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:44.210
Andou fell asleep at his desk, and his glasses made rings on his face!

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:48.420
Kashino overslept, and was almost late!

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:49.880
That's never happened before.

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:55.130
Satsuki took just an hour to fix himself up this morning.

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:56.650
It was far too short a time!

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.100
That's short!?

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:05.380
I wish we could be of help somehow.

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:07.120
The stress is piling up.

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:10.490
We can't do anything at this rate.

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:35.230
Good morning!

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:37.290
Today's the last day of special training, isn't it?

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:39.730
We'll do our best today, and tomorrow's the finals.

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:42.210
We're heading out!

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:47.710
We have a Court Pâtissier exam in the Kingdom of Sweets today!

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:49.320
Oh, really?

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.280
We'll be back by tonight.

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:55.280
Well then, let's go to the Kingdom of Sweets!

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:16.800
Finished.

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:24.890
You worked really hard.

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:27.890
Seriously, this was tough.

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:32.440
But I think we've mastered enough of the high school techniques.

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:35.600
Vanilla, we're finished!

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:38.490
You can come in now!

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:44.550
Huh? Maybe they're not back yet?

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:47.790
Didn't they say they'd be back by evening?

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:55.880
Tennouji-san!

00:17:56.760 --> 00:18:00.100
Your Spirits haven't come back from the Kingdom?

00:18:00.710 --> 00:18:07.150
Yes. They said they had a Court Pâtissier exam and that they'd be back by evening, but...

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:09.650
Is there some way we could send a message?

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:11.630
That's odd.

00:18:12.810 --> 00:18:16.190
There's no exam scheduled for this month.

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:20.070
There must be some other reason for them to return to the Kingdom.

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:23.850
You're saying they lied to us and left?

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:26.600
I don't think Cafe-kun and the others would do that...

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:27.760
No.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:34.460
We were so caught up in practicing that we didn't pay enough attention to them...

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:36.190
Maybe...

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:38.250
They all ran away from home?

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:41.630
Hey! Who are you saying ran away from home!?

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:43.330
Vanilla!

00:18:51.010 --> 00:18:52.020
Everyone!

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:55.310
How mean! Don't say we ran away!

00:18:55.310 --> 00:19:01.250
Honey-sama, we apologise for causing our partners trouble!

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:05.450
H-Hey now... Why are you all so late?

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:08.790
The train was running late.

00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:12.310
Now, we have gifts for everyone!

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:13.700
There!

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:21.410
These are... for us?

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:22.520
Oui!

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:25.860
When you're tired, nothing beats sweets, right?

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:27.350
You all made them for us?

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:32.630
We wanted to be of help to everyone.

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:35.650
Because we're your partners!

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:37.960
You were all practicing really hard,

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:40.240
so we couldn't just stand there and watch, doing nothing.

00:19:40.930 --> 00:19:44.570
So we figured we'd make our specialty sweets to cheer everyone up.

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:48.740
We casted Sweets Magic that'll make you feel refreshed!

00:19:48.740 --> 00:19:51.390
We made these from the bottom of our hearts!

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:53.250
Vanilla...

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:55.750
Chocolat...

00:19:57.220 --> 00:19:58.300
Cafe-kun...

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:03.610
Caramel, you all are such good people!

00:20:03.610 --> 00:20:05.910
Andou, thank you!

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:09.660
I'll never lie to you and leave again!

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:11.480
Me, neither!

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:14.480
I'll never... never let you go again!

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:23.240
Team Ichigo... The bonds with your Spirits are strong.

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:24.910
You have an excellent team.

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:31.410
Tennouji-san... Umm... I apologise for bothering you with this.

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:33.140
It's all right.

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:35.630
Thanks to you, I've seen something good.

00:20:37.490 --> 00:20:41.490
Instead of focusing on showy presentation, you've been mastering the fundamentals.

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:43.510
Your decision is correct.

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:49.680
The finals tomorrow looks like it'll be a good match.

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:53.460
So she knows our cards, I guess?

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:54.890
I wonder...

00:20:57.080 --> 00:21:00.070
That's right... Finally, tomorrow...

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:12.820
With my friends who've struggled all this way together, we aim for Paris.

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:19.750
We will not lose!

