00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:02.480
Dream-coloured Magical Essence!

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:04.530
Genoise!

00:23:07.740 --> 00:23:12.920
Genoise is a dough that's used in shortcakes and the like, often called "sponge".

00:23:12.920 --> 00:23:17.200
It is said to have originated from Genova, Italy.

00:23:17.480 --> 00:23:19.710
Ichigo has agreed to demonstrate it personally.

00:23:20.270 --> 00:23:25.050
Pour in egg and sugar into a bowl, and whip it above hot water.

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:31.250
When the dough gets warm, remove it from the hot water and continue to whip it.

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:35.580
It's okay when it has become sticky and creamy!

00:23:35.580 --> 00:23:39.400
Add in flour into the dough and mix it well.

00:23:39.910 --> 00:23:45.820
Finally, add in melted butter into the dough, and let's mix it well uniformly.

00:23:47.220 --> 00:23:51.130
Next, pour it in a template and put it into a preheated oven.

00:23:51.130 --> 00:23:55.830
Bake it at 180°C and it will be done in about 30 minutes!

00:23:56.430 --> 00:23:59.750
Yes! It looks delicious, doesn't it?

00:24:00.360 --> 00:24:06.190
Amano-san, your simple, innocent determination has always been a threat to me.

00:24:06.190 --> 00:24:10.630
But when I heard your memories of your grandmother, I was convinced.

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:14.590
If I win, it proves my feelings to Henri-sensei...

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:18.750
...are stronger and bigger than yours.

00:24:18.750 --> 00:24:20.540
